      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What fits inside the harness: almost any app — tools, trackers, games, charts, forms, dashboards, apps that call declared web APIs — limited only by the\ncapability modules the harness ships. Export can add more native modules (its own background work, share targets, its own widgets). Always blocked, even\nwhen exported: accessibility control, SMS, device admin, overlays, notification access, hidden icons.",
      "originalText": "What fits inside the harness: almost any app — tools, trackers, games, charts, forms, dashboards, apps that call declared web APIs — limited only by the\ncapability modules the harness ships. Export can add more native modules (its own background work, share targets, its own widgets). Always blocked, even\nwhen exported: accessibility control, SMS, device admin, overlays, notification access, hidden icons.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
